            "span": [
              384,
              770
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "row": "notes",
      "title": "The cost",
      "text": "Attention is S × S where S counts text + conditioning + audio + video rows together. Audio is cheap (a handful of rows per latent) but it is still inside the quadratic term, and so is every text token.",
      "code": [
        {
